# Match artifacts (calibration sweeps, SPRT runs, ad-hoc PGN dumps).
# Patterns cover both well-named files (calibration.pgn, sprt.log) and
# typo'd cousins (`-pgnout citt-vs-sf-pgn` missing the dot).
/*.pgn
/*.log
/*-pgn
/*-log
